==Battleground==
*10 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Berserkory]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavy Assault C.A.T. (Enemy)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*12 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 143.33 seconds<sup>4,300f</sup>, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very similar to [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 25|the original Floor 25]], except most of the enemies have higher magnifications than before, making them much harder to deal with. The absence of the Gory Darks doesn't help, as it removes a main money source. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]], when boosted, is a great choice against the Bore Jrs, if you can manage to time him correctly, as do almost all [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Blockers]] and [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immune]] units.

